{{ref:11_reports_and_receipts/m2_seal/m2_seal_delivery_receipt.yaml#article_landing.by_article.A2.measurement.threshold_frozen_count}} 项、
时序门 {{ref:11_reports_and_receipts/m2_seal/m2_seal_delivery_receipt.yaml#article_landing.by_article.A2.measurement.timing_gate_preconditions}} 项满足
{{ref:11_reports_and_receipts/m2_seal/m2_seal_delivery_receipt.yaml#article_landing.by_article.A2.measurement.timing_gate_satisfied}} 项、
